    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Applied by <strong>Nobody Crosses</strong> to each affected enemy.</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p>Declare the line and hold it. Any creature attempting to cross it must attempt a Reflex save against your class DC; on a failure its movement stops and it takes damage equal to two of your weapon's damage dice, and on a critical failure it is also knocked prone on its own side. Enemies that have seen this happen to someone else take a −2 circumstance penalty to that save. This does not cost you reactions or ammunition.</p>"
